            "author_association": "MEMBER",
            "body": "With current implementation, it doesn't seem like there will be negative consequences to other 'mini.completion' functionalities. However, this type of disabling is not \"officially\" supported and tested. The way to do it is like you said: set very high value to `config.delay.completion`. It doesn't seem like it is adding that much of an overhead on every `InsertCharPre`, if that is your concern.",
